---
import ResearchFigureFrame from './ResearchFigureFrame.astro';
---

<ResearchFigureFrame
  eyebrow="Figure 05"
  status="Observed repository inconsistency"
  title="Persistence without reconciliation"
  caption="Version control makes drift visible; it does not perform maintenance. This figure does not assert that either artifact automatically outranks the other."
>
  <div class="drift-status">
    <span>Divergence</span>
    <p>An accepted decision record and the repository's current operating guidance now describe different production-publishing models.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="drift-comparison">
    <section>
      <div class="heading-row">
        <span class="label">Earlier accepted record</span>
        <span class="date">ADR 003 · 2026-08-26</span>
      </div>
      <strong>Manual publishing model</strong>
      <p>Centers production publishing on <code>npm run live</code> from <code>main</code> and says a repository-authored Actions workflow is not required.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <span class="label">Current guidance + implementation</span>
      <strong>Three supported paths</strong>
      <ol>
        <li><span>01</span><span>Local <code>npm run live</code></span></li>
        <li><span>02</span><span>GitHub Actions manual dispatch</span></li>
        <li><span>03</span><span>Remote trigger branch</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="source-note">Confirmed in AGENTS.md, README.md, and .github/workflows/deploy-production.yml</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="drift-outcomes">
    <div><span>Preserved</span><p>Both accounts remain inspectable.</p></div>
    <div><span>Not resolved</span><p>The repository does not automatically choose a winner.</p></div>
    <div><span>Human action</span><p>Amend, supersede, or reconcile the record.</p></div>
  </div>
</ResearchFigureFrame>

<style>
  .drift-status {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.9rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .drift-status span,
  .label,
  .date,
  .source-note,
  .drift-outcomes span,
  li > span:first-child,
  code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono-ui);
  }

  .drift-status span,
  .label,
  .date,
  .drift-outcomes span {
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .drift-status span,
  .drift-outcomes span {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .drift-status p {
    margin: 0 !important;
    max-width: 48rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .drift-comparison {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  section {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .heading-row {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .label,
  .date,
  .source-note {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  section > strong {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  section > p {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0 !important;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  code {
    display: inline;
    border: 0 !important;
    border-radius: 0 !important;
    background: transparent !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
    text-transform: none;
  }

  ol {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    margin: 0.65rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.8rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  li > span:first-child {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.625rem;
  }

  .source-note {
    margin-top: 0.8rem !important;
    color: var(--text-muted) !important;
    font-size: 0.65rem !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    line-height: 1.6 !important;
    text-transform: none;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .drift-outcomes {
    display: grid;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .drift-outcomes > div {
    padding: 0.8rem 0;
  }

  .drift-outcomes > div + div {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .drift-outcomes p {
    margin: 0.3rem 0 0 !important;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  @media (min-width: 760px) {
    .drift-status {
      grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: baseline;
    }

    .drift-comparison {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 0;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .drift-comparison section {
      padding-right: 1.5rem;
    }

    .drift-comparison section + section {
      border-left: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding-right: 0;
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }

    .heading-row {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .drift-outcomes {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .drift-outcomes > div {
      padding: 0.8rem 0.9rem;
    }

    .drift-outcomes > div + div {
      border-top: 0;
      border-left: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }
  }
</style>
